@startuml
title Платформа аренды ТС - Maintenance & Deployment Processes

skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
' Убрали ortho, чтобы линии были плавными и не слипались

' === CI/CD PIPELINE ===
card "CI/CD Pipeline" {
  card "Development" {
    card "Git (Feature Branches)" as git
    card "Developers" as devs
    
    ' Backend tools
    card "Docker Build (Jib)" as build_be
    card "Unit: Kotest + MockK" as unit_be
    card "Integ: Testcontainers" as integ_be
    
    ' Frontend/Mobile tools
    card "Build Web/Mobile" as build_fe
    card "Unit: Jest" as unit_fe
    card "E2E: Playwright/Detox" as e2e
    
    card "Load: k6" as perf
  }

  card "Staging" {
    card "Deploy to Staging K8s" as staging_deploy
    card "Fastlane (Beta Release)" as fastlane_beta
    card "API Contract Tests" as api_tests
  }

  card "Production" {
    card "Blue-Green Deployment" as bluegreen
    card "Fastlane (Store Release)" as fastlane_prod
    card "Rollback Procedure" as rollback
    database "Production Kubernetes" as k8s_prod
    card "App Store / Google Play" as app_stores
  }
}

' === КОММЕНТАРИИ ДЛЯ CI/CD ===
note left of fastlane_beta
  <b>Mobile DevOps (Fastlane)</b>
  • Сборка .ipa / .apk
  • Отправка в TestFlight
  • Управление сертификатами
  • Авто-скриншоты
end note

note right of perf
  <b>Нагрузочное тестирование (k6)</b>
  • Эмуляция пикового спроса
  • Тест сценария "Поиск авто"
  • Проверка SLA по задержкам
end note

' === MONITORING & OBSERVABILITY ===
card "Monitoring & Observability" {
  card "Prometheus" as prometheus
  card "Elasticsearch (Logs)" as elk_logs
  card "Jaeger/Zipkin" as tracing
  card "AlertManager" as alertmanager
  card "Grafana Dashboards" as grafana
  card "Sentry" as sentry
}

' === КОММЕНТАРИИ ДЛЯ MONITORING ===
note right of tracing
  <b>Distributed Tracing</b>
  • Отслеживание пути запроса
  • Gateway -> Search -> Vehicle
  • Поиск узких мест (latency)
  • Визуализация водопада
end note

note left of sentry
  <b>Error Tracking</b>
  • Сбор крэшей iOS/Android
  • JS ошибки фронтенда
  • Стек-трейсы исключений Kotlin
  • Группировка инцидентов
end note

note right of elk_logs
  <b>Centralized Logging</b>
  • Логи всех микросервисов
  • Correlation ID из трассировки
  • Аудит действий админов
  • Анализ безопасности
end note

' === MAINTENANCE PROCEDURES ===
card "Maintenance Procedures" {
  card "PostgreSQL Vacuum" as pg_maint
  card "Elasticsearch Reindexing" as es_maint
  card "Kafka Rebalancing" as kafka_maint
  card "S3 Lifecycle Policies" as s3_maint
  card "Daily Backups (Wal-G)" as backups
  card "SSL Renewal" as ssl
}

' === КОММЕНТАРИИ ДЛЯ MAINTENANCE ===
note left of pg_maint
  <b>Обслуживание PostgreSQL</b>
  • Очистка dead tuples (VACUUM)
  • Обновление статистики
  • Проверка bloat индексов
end note

note right of es_maint
  <b>Обслуживание Поиска</b>
  • Zero-downtime reindex
  • Удаление старых индексов
  • Оптимизация шардов
  • Изменение маппинга
end note

note left of s3_maint
  <b>Очистка S3</b>
  • Удаление временных файлов
  • Архивация в Glacier
  • Очистка фото удаленных авто
end note

note right of kafka_maint
  <b>Kafka Maintenance</b>
  • Управление Retention
  • Мониторинг Consumer Lag
  • Балансировка партиций
end note

' === AUTOMATION ===
card "Automation" {
  card "GitOps - ArgoCD" as argocd
  card "Terraform" as terraform
  card "Flyway Migrations" as migrations
}

note right of migrations
  <b>Миграции БД (Flyway)</b>
  • Версионирование схемы
  • Накат в Init-контейнерах
  • Проверка совместимости
  • Откат неудачных миграций
end note

' === SERVICE LEVEL INDICATORS ===
card "Business SLIs" {
  card "Search Latency: <200ms" as search_sli
  card "Booking Success: >99.5%" as booking_sli
  card "Index Freshness: <5s" as index_sli
}

note left of index_sli
  <b>Актуальность поиска</b>
  • Критическая метрика для CQRS
  • Задержка между записью в БД
    и появлением в поиске
  • Мониторинг Kafka Consumer
end note

' === СВЯЗИ (упрощенные для читаемости) ===

' Pipeline
devs --> git
git --> build_be
git --> build_fe

build_be --> unit_be
unit_be --> integ_be
integ_be --> staging_deploy

build_fe --> unit_fe
unit_fe --> e2e
e2e --> fastlane_beta
e2e --> staging_deploy

staging_deploy --> perf
perf --> api_tests
api_tests --> bluegreen
api_tests --> fastlane_prod

bluegreen --> k8s_prod
fastlane_prod --> app_stores

' Monitoring connections
k8s_prod --> prometheus
k8s_prod --> elk_logs
k8s_prod --> tracing
app_stores --> sentry

prometheus --> grafana
elk_logs --> grafana
tracing --> grafana
prometheus --> alertmanager

' Maintenance connections
pg_maint --> k8s_prod
es_maint --> k8s_prod
kafka_maint --> k8s_prod
s3_maint --> k8s_prod
backups --> k8s_prod
migrations --> k8s_prod

' Automation connections
argocd --> k8s_prod
terraform --> k8s_prod

' Metrics connections
prometheus --> search_sli
prometheus --> booking_sli
prometheus --> index_sli

note right of k8s_prod
  <b>Production Environment</b>
  • PostgreSQL Cluster
  • Elasticsearch Cluster
  • Kafka Cluster
  • Redis Cluster
end note

@enduml